# Banana Pudding

### Ingredients

- 2 cups milk (cold)
- 1 (5 oz) package of instant vanilla pudding mix
- 1 (14 oz) can sweetened condensed milk
- 1 Tablespoon vanilla extract
- 1 (12 oz) container Cool Whip, thawed
- 1 (16oz) package nilla wafers
- 7 bananas, sliced

### Instructions

- Combine milk and pudding mix in a large bowl ; beat with a whisk for 2 minutes.

- Blend in condensed milk until smooth. 

- Stir in vanilla, then fold in Cool Whip (folding to keep fluffiness).

- Layer banana pudding in large bowl with wafers then banana slices then pudding mixture.  

- For best results, chill in the fridge for at least an hour before serving. Top with extra crushed wafers before serving! 